1
00:00:00,900 --> 00:00:04,213
From Port Harcourt, Rivers State, Nigeria,

2
00:00:04,213 --> 00:00:06,475
comes a community passionate about opening

3
00:00:06,475 --> 00:00:08,412
doors for women in technology.

4
00:00:09,408 --> 00:00:11,208
We are PyLadies Rivers.

5
00:00:13,600 --> 00:00:16,200
Our mission is simple: to encourage,

6
00:00:16,200 --> 00:00:19,275
support and empower women to explore programming,

7
00:00:19,275 --> 00:00:21,512
develop practical Python skills,

8
00:00:21,512 --> 00:00:23,750
and build confidence in technology.

9
00:00:27,600 --> 00:00:30,163
Led by our chapter organizer and mentor,

10
00:00:30,163 --> 00:00:32,812
Fredrick Ughimi, PyLadies Rivers is building

11
00:00:32,812 --> 00:00:35,775
a welcoming environment where learners can grow together,

12
00:00:35,775 --> 00:00:37,800
share knowledge and support one another.

13
00:00:40,600 --> 00:00:43,350
Through our structured Python mentorship programme,

14
00:00:43,350 --> 00:00:45,150
we guide learners from the fundamentals

15
00:00:45,150 --> 00:00:48,337
of programming to practical exercises and assignments.

16
00:00:49,324 --> 00:00:51,062
We make learning accessible,

17
00:00:51,062 --> 00:00:54,449
interactive and supportive, especially for beginners.

18
00:00:57,100 --> 00:00:59,212
We are growing beyond online learning,

19
00:00:59,212 --> 00:01:02,750
with hands-on experiences and stronger community connections.

20
00:01:03,712 --> 00:01:05,475
We are excited about our upcoming

21
00:01:05,475 --> 00:01:08,212
in-person Python workshop in Port Harcourt,

22
00:01:08,212 --> 00:01:10,462
planned for February 2027.

23
00:01:14,100 --> 00:01:15,400
Whether you are just starting

24
00:01:15,400 --> 00:01:16,925
or growing your skills,

25
00:01:16,925 --> 00:01:18,500
there is a place for you here.

26
00:01:19,488 --> 00:01:21,438
One line of Python at a time,

27
00:01:21,438 --> 00:01:24,363
we are creating opportunities for women in technology.

28
00:01:25,356 --> 00:01:27,156
We are PyLadies Rivers!

